p.src:
Creation and annihilation operators act on kets in the familiar way: $\begin{aligned}
a^\dagger\lvert n\rangle&=\sqrt{n+1}\,\lvert n+1\rangle,\\
a\lvert n\rangle&=\sqrt n\,\lvert n-1\rangle.\end{aligned}$ The creation and annihilation operators may also be denoted $a^+$ and $a^-$; here $a^\dagger$ and $a$ will be used throughout.

